{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は七夕でしたね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん何かお願い事しましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、去年までは学校で短冊書いてたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は短冊見もしなかったなぁ(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ニュースで発表されたのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の10人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19日放送のNHK大河ドラマ「花燃ゆ」に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょこっと出演させていただくことになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大河初出演です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか出演できる日が来るとは思ってなかったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくり、光栄です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カツラが予想以上に重たくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おじぎするとき頭が落っこちそうになったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと真夏が大変そうでした...(*ﾟｰﾟ)>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、でもほんとにね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼女は泣きながら頑張ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/07/08/6254223/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カツラをはずしたあとは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/07/08/6254223/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スッキリーーー！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},